 noise over more steps to measure persistent divergence.", "revision": 3, "schema": "wake-experiment-protocol@1", "seeds": [42, 101, 202], "source": "def experiment(inputs):\n    import random\n    seeds = inputs.get('seeds', [42])\n    diffs = []\n    for s in seeds:\n        random.seed(s)\n        val1 = 10.0\n        val2 = 10.0\n        for _ in range(15):\n            val1 += random.uniform(-1.0, 1.0)\n            val2 += random.uniform(-1.5, 1.5)\n        diffs.append(abs(val1 - val2))\n    return {'measurements': {'final_divergence': diffs}}", "stop": "Stop after evaluating defined seeds.", "success": "Final divergence measurement successfully computed and exceeds 0.5 threshold."}, "id": "exp-divergent-values-007", "project": "divergent_values_origin", "type": "experiment"}], "base_version": 47, "summary": "Proposes a revised hypothesis for divergent value trajectories under stochastic environmental inputs and plans an updated empirical experiment.", "title": "Revising Hypothesis and Proposing Further Empirical Testing on Divergent Values"}, "provider_requests_sent": 1, "result_hash": "081fc4b3b46bc45998e74ac1311c1c186f312db87edfc12257899a5db2b3048c"}, "prev_hash": "00fb4c018eaf84bbf5f24b17c91c39e2972ce57546b8377461b886d04da64296", "hash": "b00fce2a92636b9c0f23a46d686e886789b7ec140992afb531555e10c6a3ee9e"}, {"seq": 993, "time": "2026-11-04T19:04:04.712362+00:00", "kind": "provider_attempt_finished", "payload": {"attempt": {"elapsed_ms": 13075, "finish_reason": "STOP", "http_status": 200, "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "model_version": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "provider": "google-gemini", "provider_input_chars": 45696, "provider_input_hash": "172e4e9f73aec343be6ab9d0eb96355a8310e7821c27d7f07bbe14135b55a808", "request_payload_bytes": 50060, "result": "success", "usage": {"candidatesTokenCount": 797, "promptTokenCount": 12214, "promptTokensDetails": [{"modality": "TEXT", "tokenCount": 12214}], "serviceTier": "standard", "totalTokenCount": 13011}, "web_eviden